    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this charming detached two-storey residence, ideally situated in the heart of Bailieborough town centre. Offering approximately 91 m² of accommodation, the property is in need of some renovation and modernisation, presenting an excellent opportunity for purchasers looking to put their own stamp on a centrally located home.\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, a comfortable living room featuring a marble fireplace, and a fitted kitchen. Upstairs, there is a landing, two spacious double bedrooms, one of which benefits from a feature fireplace, together with a tiled bathroom fitted with a shower.\r\nExternally, the property boasts a spacious rear garden, along with a garage and a number of useful outbuildings, providing excellent additional storage and scope for a variety of uses.\r\nThe property is ideally positioned within walking distance of Bailieborough town centre, with a wide range of local shops, schools, services and amenities all close at hand. Its central location, combined with the opportunity to renovate and upgrade the existing accommodation, makes this an attractive prospect for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a renovation project.\r\nBuilt circa 1930, the property benefits from oil-fired central heating, mains water and mains sewage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime town-centre location, within walking distance of shops, schools and local amenities\r\nTwo spacious double bedrooms\r\nLiving room with marble fireplace\r\nAdditional feature fireplace in one bedroom\r\nFitted kitchen\r\nSpacious rear garden\r\nGarage and outbuildings\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\nMains water and mains sewage"
      },
